  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n1994-1999 Chevy C/K 1500 2500 3500 Silverado, Suburban\n1995-1999 Chevy Tahoe\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 1994 1995 1996 1997 1998 1999 Chevy C/K 1500 2500 3500, 1994-1999 Chevy C/K Silverado, 1994-1999 Chevy C/K Suburban, 1994-1999 Chevy C1500 C2500 C3500 K1500 K2500 K3500; 1995-1999 Chevy Tahoe; high beam bulb type: HB3; low beam bulb type: HB4; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof Design: Fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter & Safer: Lights minimize obnoxious glare during the night; the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact Resistance: The polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
